      "content": "thanks, that looks much better. i was wondering though, what would you say is the main issue with how the customer was speaking in the first place? like, if i had to explain to my boss why we can't use the original text in the manual, how would u describe their style of speaking? is it just a matter of grammar or is there something else about the way it comes across?",
